  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "metadata": {
    "title": "Verified metro station points from the local HOTOSM/OSM railway snapshot",
    "generatedAt": "2026-10-11",
    "source": {
      "dataset": "HOTOSM/OSM Indian railways GeoJSON",
      "localFile": "data/source/hotosm/railways.geojson",
      "snapshotDate": "2026-05-10",
      "provenance": "Each feature retains the OSM object identifier and unmodified point coordinates from the local snapshot."
    },
    "methodology": "A feature is included only when the source geometry is a Point with railway=station, its source name matches a station on the cited current operator route list after case/punctuation normalization or an explicitly recorded name alias, and the point belongs to the cited operating metro corridor. No coordinates were interpolated or moved. Generic Indian Railways and suburban-rail points in the same metro areas are excluded.",
    "matchedFeatureCounts": {
      "kochi": 24,
      "mumbai": 28,
      "pune": 29
    },
    "limitations": [
      "HOTOSM's exported station features do not carry reliable metro operator or line tags; official route lists are used only to validate names and operating corridor membership.",
      "This base bundle contains 24 of Kochi's 25 named passenger-stop records. The supplemental file adds Vyttila from a source station-footprint polygon centroid. KMRL's homepage separately reports 26 elevated stations; that discrepancy is not resolved by the map layer.",
      "This base bundle covers 15 named Line 2A and all 13 named Line 7 records. The supplemental file adds all 12 Line 1 stations, 17 of 27 Line 3 stations, five of six open Line 2B stations, and all four open Line 9 stations. Two Line 2A names and other unlisted stations remain unmatched.",
      "This base bundle contains 29 Pune station-point records. The supplemental file adds the operator-listed Mahatma Phule Mandai point, yielding 30 records and 29 distinct names; the two separately mapped Civil Court corridor points are retained. The operator webpage has both Kasba Peth and Budhwar Peth labels, while this OSM snapshot labels the point Kasba Peth."
    ]
  },
